CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1792200257
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJudge throws out child sex abuse
OL,4,Acharges against actor Timothy Busfield
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe judge said on Friday that the
OL,7,Fprosecutor "failed to act in a fair and
OL,8,Fimpartial manner". The district
OL,9,Fattorney's office said it is evaluating
OL,10,Foptions on how to move forward.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
